ay-200 pb-2\'><span class=\'text-gray-500 text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0\'>Ödeme</span><span class=\'text-gray-800 font-bold text-[13px] text-right ml-3 break-words\'>Nakit</span></div><div class=\'flex justify-between items-center pt-1\'><span class=\'text-gray-800 font-black text-[13px]\'>Toplam Tutar</span><span class=\'text-red-600 font-black text-lg\'>140.00 ₺</span></div></div><div class=\'p-2 bg-white border-t border-gray-200\'><button onclick=\"sendChip(\'Onaylıyorum\')\" class=\'w-full bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-black py-2.5 rounded-xl transition shadow-md flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm\'><span class=\'text-base\'>✅</span> SİPARİŞİ ONAYLA</button></div></div>\n\n👤 Müşteri: Tamam\n\n👤 Asistan: \n\n👤 Asistan: <div class=\'w-full max-w-sm mx-auto my-2 bg-white border border-green-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md box-border\'><div class=\'bg-green-500 text-white text-center py-2.5\'><div class=\'text-2xl mb-0.5\'>✅</div><div class=\'font-black text-[13px] uppercase tracking-wide\'>SİPARİŞ ONAYLANDI</div></div><div class=\'p-3 sm:p-4 space-y-2.5 bg-stone-50\'><div class=\'flex justify-between items-center border-b border-gray-200 pb-2\'><span class=\'text-gray-500 text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0\'>Sipariş No</span><span class=\'text-gray-800 font-black text-sm\'>#82</span></div><div class=\'flex justify-between items-center border-b border-gray-200 pb-2\'><span class=\'text-gray-500 text-xs font-bold flex-shrink-0\'>Ödenecek Tutar</span><span class=\'text-red-600 font-black text-sm\'>140.00 ₺</span></div><div class=\'text-center text-gray-600 text-xs font-medium pt-2 leading-relaxed\'>Tostunuz özenle hazırlanıp en kısa sürede adresinize ulaştırılacaktır.<br><br>📞 İletişim: <span class=\'font-bold text-gray-800\'>0224 224 24 04</span><br><br>Afiyet olsun! 🔥</div></div></div>\n\n', '2026-10-04 16:58:51'),
